# Driftwood Shores Resort, Florence, Oregon

8/10/2025

Their pizza is simply amazing. Its greasy, which I personally love, (I know some of you may not) its cheese is perfect, and its dough is immaculate. 

I got a 16" pepperoni pizza, and ate it all by myself, nearly all in one sitting, with just 1 slice left. 

The chef came out to see and was amazed this skinny ass fella could put down that much pizza lmfao.

10/10 pepperonis for me, if you want some good pizza in Florence Oregon, this is definitely one of the best spots.

mdend